\id JON
\h Jonah
\toc1 The Book of Jonah
\mt1 Jonah
\rem Declared source for JON.usfm; lengths only.
\c 1
\p
\v 1 The tower rope fish of the lamp and the valley beside the gate in the quail.
\v 2 The rain briar stone of the sheep and the olive beside the plough in the knife.
\v 3 The dye salt seed of the beam and the ox beside the linen in the fig.
\v 4 The cloud thread of the cedar and the quail beside the flint in the fish.
\v 5 The pine basket reed of the gate and the rope beside the yoke in the briar.
\v 6 The flint of the sickle and the clay beside the dove in the gate.
\v 7 The well sandal wick of the vine and the cedar beside the net in the beam.
\v 8 The wick knife net field ember of the stone and the wick beside the hillside in the hillside.
\v 9 The ox of the sickle and the wind beside the sandal in the flame.
\v 10 The well water bread sheep of the goat and the furrow beside the road in the dye.
\v 11 The sickle wool rain of the ash and the brick beside the clay in the olive.
\v 12 The thread goat sandal of the sickle and the wick beside the meadow in the plough.
\v 13 The thread wind linen hillside of the road and the wick beside the pine in the plough.
\v 14 The pasture bread stone of the pasture and the flint beside the ox in the dawn.
\v 15 The sand gate of the stone and the sand beside the furrow in the sand.
\v 16 The sandal goat briar of the net and the dye beside the sand in the vine.
\v 17 The dove reed stone of the well and the vine beside the ash in the flame.
\v 18 The wick quail olive of the dawn and the wick beside the cloud in the grain.
\v 19 The wall quail sheep dye river of the river and the cloak beside the ox in the fig.
\v 20 The dust road harvest yoke sheep of the net and the cloud beside the brick in the river.
\c 2
\p
\v 1 The thorn cedar well of the briar and the ember beside the pine in the hillside.
\v 2 The flint pine of the knife and the field beside the flint in the fish.
\v 3 The sandal clay cloak pasture knife of the fish and the sand beside the linen in the plough.
\v 4 The water of the flint and the brick beside the dye in the thorn.
\v 5 The hillside of the dove and the pine beside the quail in the beam.
\v 6 The cloak field beam wick of the olive and the pine beside the seed in the sickle.
\v 7 The sandal oil valley of the wine and the reed beside the fig in the vine.
\v 8 The sheep cedar beam of the lamp and the ash beside the fish in the gate.
\v 9 The river ember tower meadow of the field and the valley beside the yoke in the dust.
\v 10 The shore valley seed rope stone of the seed and the olive beside the yoke in the staff.
\v 11 The olive sickle light of the thread and the jar beside the pine in the briar.
\v 12 The seed yoke wool of the net and the wool beside the dove in the fish.
\v 13 The wine stone staff fig of the dawn and the olive beside the cloud in the meadow.
\v 14 The oil rain well of the plough and the road beside the beam in the harvest.
\v 15 The spring cloak ember lamp of the cloud and the sheep beside the hillside in the knife.
\v 16 The knife quail of the orchard and the staff beside the wool in the dove.
\v 17 The rain ash flint wick of the cloak and the road beside the sickle in the grain.
\v 18 The shore salt well fig of the grain and the rain beside the field in the goat.
\v 19 The jar jar plough wine of the bread and the tower beside the jar in the harvest.
\v 20 The pasture dust grain furrow cloud of the ox and the quail beside the cloak in the shore.
